<br/>
<br/>With the removal of AP and increase in value to Agility, you'll find that most of the Pre-BiS pieces will be focused around the highest item level you can gather and then looking for favorable secondary stats.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">
<span class="c4">Body Armor for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Head for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77148/nocturnal-gaze">
<img alt="Nocturnal Gaze" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raidrogue_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nocturnal Gaze</span></a> is by far and away our best helm option in pre-bis. Any of the 3 subsequent items are close to each other with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78794/blackfang-battleweave-helmet">
<img alt="Blackfang Battleweave Helmet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_leather_raidrogue_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blackfang Battleweave Helmet</span></a> having a slight lead.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62369/arcanum-of-the-ramkahen">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Ramkahen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Ramkahen</span></a> from being Revered with the <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>
