<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Shoulders for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78375/underdwellers-spaulders">
<img alt="Underdweller's Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_leather_raidrogue_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Underdweller's Spaulders</span></a> are best here, but we opt to take <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78833/blackfang-battleweave-spaulders">
