<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-assassination-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Trinkets for Assassination Rogue DPS</span></h4>Trinkets are fairly straightforward in pre-bis. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77979/vial-of-shadows">
<img alt="Vial of Shadows" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_potion_85.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vial of Shadows</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77974/wrath-of-unchaining">
<img alt="Wrath of Unchaining" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_coin_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrath of Unchaining</span></a> are both very impactful trinkets that can be directly farmed with the new dungeons. Both of these come ahead of the T12 BiS options as well as the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
